### 发送评论（需要登录，token）
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/send
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyQSIsInJvbGUiOjAsImlhdCI6MTc3NTkwODAyNiwiZXhwIjoxNzc1OTk0NDI2fQ.Cs95M42UKXx1DL-ahDKMP4spYLdEWjSoOH4-yIGgJvo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toUserId": 1,
  "targetType": 0,
  "targetId": 1,
  "content": "你好，我捡到了你的校园卡"
}

### 获取失物id=1的评论列表（公开，无需token）
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/target?targetType=0&targetId=1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyQSIsInJvbGUiOjAsImlhdCI6MTc3NTkwODQzOSwiZXhwIjoxNzc1OTk0ODM5fQ.iXQEAsOUbIm3E9cOh2nSVXfOjc23RyF2zO-8Ns4uGEQ

### 获取未读消息数（需token）
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/unread/count
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyQSIsInJvbGUiOjAsImlhdCI6MTc3NTkwODAyNiwiZXhwIjoxNzc1OTk0NDI2fQ.Cs95M42UKXx1DL-ahDKMP4spYLdEWjSoOH4-yIGgJvo

### 标记消息为已读（需token）
PUT http://localhost:8080/comment/read/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyQSIsInJvbGUiOjAsImlhdCI6MTc3NTkwODAyNiwiZXhwIjoxNzc1OTk0NDI2fQ.Cs95M42UKXx1DL-ahDKMP4spYLdEWjSoOH4-yIGgJvo